## Starter Repo Taxonomy Expectations

For each starter repo (digitalmodel, worldenergydata, assethold, assetutilities), the expected top-level structure:

repo-name/
├── AGENTS.md
├── CLAUDE.md
├── README.md
├── .claude/
├── .codex/
├── .gemini/
├── .gitignore
├── src/ or repo_name/
├── tests/
├── docs/
├── pyproject.toml
└── .mcp.json
```

